  "bio": "Erik Ruta, based in Poznań, Poland, is a gifted tattoo artist specializing in illustrative and neo-traditional styles. He is currently honing his impressive skills as an apprentice at Black Butterfly Studio, where he works alongside a talented crew. Erik's portfolio showcases his dedication to creating striking and unique tattoo artistry for his growing clientele.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Poznan, Greater Poland Voivodeship, Poland"
